sing gate.\n\n## Boundary compliance\n\nBoth repos verified untouched and clean (cocoaskills `dacccaaf…`, curator-spec `432eb2ee…`, 0 dirty files); PR 19's worktree untouched; `3pemm6` still `backlog`; `12r55p` still `reviewing`; no pin/tag/release/claim change.\n\nPer the reviewer constraint I supplied **no `commit_ack`** — the transition was accepted without it. Acceptance evidence is in `BUG-260802-3ibgu1_review-verdict.md` for the commit-owning mover, which commits the scope and makes the final `done` transition with `commit_ack=scope_committed`.","ttft_ms":2300,"ttft_stream_ms":1795,"time_to_request_ms":244,"type":"result","duration_ms":389585,"uuid":"ec609ff9-69a7-4b74-89de-b6986b9173a2"}
